# Sistema de Permisos

Usar PermissionGuard, PermissionButton, PermissionDropdownItem y PermissionRoute de `@/components/permissions`. Hook usePermissions de `@/contexts/usePermissions` para hasPermission, hasAnyPermission, hasAllPermissions. Definir permisos en src/constants/permissions.ts. En tablas, mostrar columna de acciones solo si hasAnyPermission(['feature.edit', 'feature.delete']).
